<div class="container">
<div class="header">
<h1>📋 Disclosure Updates Report</h1>
</div>
<div class="content">
<div class="greeting">
<h2>Hello Waqas,</h2>
<p>Hope you're doing well! Here's your daily update on entities where disclosure files have been modified:</p>
</div>
<!-- FIRM DISCLOSURES SECTION -->
<div class="update-badge">
<p>
<span>⚠️</span>
<strong>{{$json.firmChangedCount}} firms have updated disclosures</strong>
</p>
</div>
<div class="data-section">
<h3>🏢 Firms with Updated Disclosures</h3>
